## 1. Empirical Comparison: V2 Full Run vs V3 Short-Run Verification

| Metric / Verification Field | V2 Baseline Run (`SYM_PROPRIO_V2`) | V3 Short-Run Verification (`LOCAL_RESPONSE_ASYM_FB_V3`) | Status & Interpretation |
|---|---|---|---|
